  "source": "uml ropUmlStructure \"РОП — компоненты, деятельность и развёртывание\"\ndiagram D02_component \"Диаграмма компонентов\" type=component\ncomponent D02_component.ui Веб-интерфейс\nview D02_component.uiView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ui.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.auth \"Проверка прав и аудит\"\nview D02_component.authView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.auth.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.model_line \"Модельный ряд и правила\"\nview D02_component.bomView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.model_line.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.content \"Расчёты и контент\"\nview D02_component.contentView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.content.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.pub \"Публикации и очередь\"\nview D02_component.pubView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.pub.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.sup \"Адаптеры поставщиков\"\nview D02_component.supView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.sup.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.db \"Репозитории PostgreSQL\"\nview D02_component.dbView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.db.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.ext \"PC4Games и ITPartner\"\nview D02_component.extView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.ext.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.oz \"Ozon Seller\"\nview D02_component.ozView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.oz.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponent D02_component.media \"Хранилище изображений\"\nview D02_component.mediaView \"\" diagram=D02_component element=D02_component.media.part parent=D02_component.system.view\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge1 \"HTTPS / JSON\" kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge2 \"проверка роли\" kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge3 репозитории kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge4 предложения kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge5 адаптер kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge6 \"версия модельного ряда\" kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge7 \"версия карточки\" kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge8 \"HTTPS / JSON\" kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\ncomponentConnector D02_component.edge9 файлы kind=assembly owner=D02_component.system\n\nannotation annotation_91f2d1882120 \"Модульный монолит. Репозитории и аудит используются всеми бизнес-модулями; повторяющиеся зависимости опущены для читаемости.\"\nview annotation_91f2d1882120View \"\" diagram=D02_component element=annotation_91f2d1882120\ndiagram D06_activity \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\" activity=prepareCard type=activity\nactivity prepareCard \"Деятельность по подготовке и публикации карточки\"\ninitial D06_activity.a \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.aView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.a\naction D06_activity.b \"Выбрать модельный ряд\\nсоздать новую версию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.bView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.b\naction D06_activity.c \"Изменить состав\\nи разрешить группы\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.cView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.c\ndecision D06_activity.d \"Совместимо и\\nданные актуальны?\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.dView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.d\naction D06_activity.e \"Рассчитать показатели\\nподготовить контент\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.eView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.e\naction D06_activity.f \"Утвердить\\nи запустить публикацию\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.f\naction D06_activity.g \"Зафиксировать успех\\nили ошибку и уведомить\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.gView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.g\nactivityFinal D06_activity.z \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.zView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.z\naction D06_activity.fix \"Показать конфликт\\nисправить данные\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.fixView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.fix\nmerge D06_activity.mergeCorrections \"\" owner=prepareCard\nview D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.continueEditing \"\" from=D06_activity.mergeCorrections owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.c\nview view_31c1c0441ecc \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.continueEditing from=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView to=D06_activity.cView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge1 \"\" from=D06_activity.a owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.b\nview view_5174eb41b61c \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge1 from=D06_activity.aView to=D06_activity.bView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge2 \"\" from=D06_activity.b owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.mergeCorrections\nview view_3064b0cb5fa4 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge2 from=D06_activity.bView to=D06_activity.mergeCorrectionsView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge3 \"\" from=D06_activity.c owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.d\nview view_971da64e1d92 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge3 from=D06_activity.cView to=D06_activity.dView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge4 \"\" from=D06_activity.d guard=else owner=prepareCard to=D06_activity.fix\nview view_b213770194b9 \"\" diagram=D06_activity element=D06_activity.edge4 from=D06_activity.dView to=D06_activity.fixView\ncontrolFlow D06_activity.edge5 \"\" from=D06_activity.fix owner=prepareCard to=D